<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zale raised to recommended.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zale raised to recommended.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it raised Zale Corp to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Shares had been rated outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 18-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
